{"asset_key":"ep5/herohub_story_15411200","episode":"ep5","category":"herohub_story","story_id":"15411200","schema_version":1,"lang":"cn","texts":{"say:1:1541120001:1":{"text":"蒙受丰饶神神恩的图塔镇已化作一片废墟，如今的呼临也饿殍遍地，民不聊生。","source_cn":"蒙受丰饶神神恩的图塔镇已化作一片废墟，如今的呼临也饿殍...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6F17C0506668E86F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1541120002:1":{"text":"看着现在的呼临城，总让我回想起它从前的样子……","source_cn":"看着现在的呼临城，总让我回想起它从前的样子……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x748DBF7758DBA183","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1541120003:1":{"text":"从前的呼临城，是什么样子？","source_cn":"从前的呼临城，是什么样子？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3AD238D101214E77","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1541120004:1":{"text":"神堕之前，呼临是一座和谐的城邦，人人安居乐业。","source_cn":"神堕之前，呼临是一座和谐的城邦，人人安居乐业。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5E10994BCA86C94A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1541120005:1":{"text":"大约四五年前，我第一次来到这座城邦时，街头尽是热闹的市集，常有玩闹的孩童从身前跑过。","source_cn":"大约四五年前，我第一次来到这座城邦时，街头尽是热闹的市...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x80F8794B684B009C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","doc